<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mostly lower.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mostly lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 30 - IMM currency futures ended mostly lower. Sept marks traded near the daily low of $0.5762. Funds sold several thousand contracts earlier in the session, but Sept held above the contract low of $0.5756. Sterling turned lower. June NAPM on Tuesday is seen falling to 56.4, from May's 57.1. ((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
